mal(str(result))`.\n- Behaviour for NaN, infinity or non-numeric input is left unspecified and listed as a follow-up.\n\n**Out of scope:** formatting, currency symbols, currency conversion, and making the rounding mode configurable.","ttft_ms":2277,"type":"result","duration_ms":38370,"uuid":"03017e80-b976-468b-97fb-ca5d44228086","ttft_stream_ms":1262,"time_to_request_ms":137,"first_content_frame_ms":1263,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
